#: ../../source/functions/placeholder/spacer.md:1
msgid "Spacer"
msgstr "スペーサー"

#: ../../source/functions/placeholder/spacer.md:3
msgid "The spacer takes blank space between keys."
msgstr "スペーサーはキー間の空白スペースを確保します。"

#: ../../source/functions/placeholder/spacer.md:5
msgid "![1745501958126](image/spacer/1745501958126.png)"
msgstr "![1745501958126](image/spacer/1745501958126.png)"

#: ../../source/functions/placeholder/spacer.md:5
msgid "1745501958126"
msgstr "1745501958126"

#: ../../source/functions/placeholder/spacer.md:7
msgid "In the FlexDesigner"
msgstr "FlexDesigner で"

#: ../../source/functions/placeholder/spacer.md:9
msgid ""
"The spacer has background and foreground settings as well. By default, it's "
"blank, with colors all set to black. But you can still customize it if you "
"wish. Compared to the no-function-key, it additionally has an auto spacing "
"feature in the function tab. It would automatically use up the remaining "
"space in the page."
msgstr ""
"スペーサーには背景と前景の設定もあります。デフォルトでは空白で、色はすべて黒に設定されています。ただし、必要に応じてカスタマイズすることもできます。ファンクションキーなしの場合と比較して、ファンクションタブに自動スペース機能が追加されています。ページ内の残りのスペースが自動的に使用されてしまいます。"

#: ../../source/functions/placeholder/spacer.md:11
msgid "![1745501987168](image/spacer/1745501987168.png)"
msgstr "![1745501987168](image/spacer/1745501987168.png)"

#: ../../source/functions/placeholder/spacer.md:11
msgid "1745501987168"
msgstr "1745501987168"

#: ../../source/functions/placeholder/spacer.md:13
msgid "On the Flexbar"
msgstr "Flexbar 上で"

#: ../../source/functions/placeholder/spacer.md:15
msgid ""
"The spacer is displayed on the Flexbar, occupying space just like other "
"keys. But it cannot be pressed."
msgstr "スペーサーは Flexbar 上に表示され、他のキーと同様にスペースを占有します。ただし、押下はできません。"
